/**
 * Can you finish every course?
 *
 * Courses are numbered 0 .. numCourses - 1. Each pair [a, b] in prereqPairs
 * means "to take course a you must FIRST finish course b" — so the edge runs
 * b → a. Return true when some order lets you take all of them, which is the
 * same as saying the prerequisite graph has no cycle.
 *
 * @param {number} numCourses - how many courses exist
 * @param {number[][]} prereqPairs - [a, b] = "a requires b first" (edge b → a)
 * @returns {boolean} true if all courses can be finished
 */
